<title>USA: Laser Technology Inc Q1 Dec 31 net falls.</title>
<headline>Laser Technology Inc Q1 Dec 31 net falls.</headline>
<dateline>ENGLEWOOD, Colo. 1997-01-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>LASER TECHNOLOGY, INC.</p>
<p>		     Consolidated Statements of Operations</p>
<p>			 (Unaudited)</p>
<p>						     Three Months Ended</p>
<p>							   December 31,</p>
<p>						    1996		1995</p>
<p> Net sales				$2,003,356	 $2,238,373</p>
<p> Cost of goods sold			873,413	  1,034,233</p>
<p>    Gross profit			 1,129,943	  1,204,140</p>
<p> Royalty and licensing income	  180,660	     27,904</p>
<p>    Total operating income	   1,310,603	  1,232,044</p>
<p> Operating expenses		    1,180,525	    891,905</p>
<p>    Income from operations	     130,078	    340,139</p>
<p> Interest income, net		     38,546	     51,858</p>
<p>    Income before income taxes	 168,624	    391,997</p>
<p> Provision for income taxes	     59,000	    149,000</p>
<p>    Net income			     109,624	    242,997</p>
<p> Net Income per share:			0.02		 0.05</p>
<p>Weighted average number of</p>
<p>    shares outstanding		 4,999,433	  4,989,600</p>
<p>SOURCE  Laser Technology, Inc.</p>
<p>-- New York Newsdesk 212 859-1610</p>
